      "name": "快測",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "見 quiz（3 題）"
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "name": "口令帶走",
      "minutes": 0.5,
      "content": [
        "ject＝扔：reject 扔回、inject 注入、project 向前投、eject 彈出",
        "conjecture＝一起投出來的猜測；abject＝被扔到最低"
      ]
    }
  ],
